=== rule comparison on the relay (shares w in budget units; Radio width = w_R/c, gain = 1/c)
    rule                                                            w_Radio   w_Disp       c  Radio obligation        Display obligation
    R* lean-egalitarian + margin-centred gains                       0.2500   0.2500  1.0000  |m - 1.0000 r| <= 0.2500   |d - 1.0000 m| <= 0.2500
    proportional-to-type, gains of R* (theta=0.1000)                 0.2000   0.3000  1.0000  |m - 1.0000 r| <= 0.2000   |d - 1.0000 m| <= 0.3000
    proportional-to-type, free gains (theta=0.1287)                  0.1140   0.3860  0.4430  |m - 2.2573 r| <= 0.2573   |d - 0.4430 m| <= 0.3860
    slack-to-first (Radio first; = sweep from the copy seed)         0.5000   0.0000  0.8750  |m - 1.1429 r| <= 0.5714   |d - 0.8750 m| <= 0.0000
    slack-to-first (Display first; = sweep from the copy seed)       0.0000   0.5000  1.1250  |m - 0.8889 r| <= 0.0000   |d - 1.1250 m| <= 0.5000

